# This .env is only used for supply-chain detection
# === LLM Provider (AI-powered commit analysis) ===
# Supported providers:
#   openai  → https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions
#   zen     → https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/chat/completions
#   go      → https://api.opencode.ai/v1/chat/completions
#   ollama  → http://localhost:11434/api/chat (no API key required)
#
LLM_PROVIDER=openai
PROVIDER_API_KEY=
LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o
#
# === Git Platform Tokens (for commit fetching) ===
#   GITHUB_TOKEN  — GitHub API token (higher rate limits, private repo access)
#   GITLAB_TOKEN  — GitLab API token (private repo access)
#   GITEA_TOKEN   — Self-hosted Gitea token (falls back to GIT_TOKEN)
#
# GITHUB_TOKEN=
# GITLAB_TOKEN=
# GITEA_TOKEN=
